@api = https://localhost:7037
@identity = https://localhost:7013
# private_key_jwt: paste a fresh one-time assertion from  pwsh tools/New-ClientAssertion.ps1 -ClientId eduEco-svc-dev
@svcAssertion = <CLIENT_ASSERTION>

### 1. Service token (client_credentials, bound to tenant demo-school)
# @name token
POST {{identity}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=eduEco-svc-dev&client_assertion_type=urn%3Aietf%3Aparams%3Aoauth%3Aclient-assertion-type%3Ajwt-bearer&client_assertion={{svcAssertion}}&scope=api.read

### 2. Who am I (effective permissions)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 3. Current tenant (tenants.read; allowed for service clients)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/tenants/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 4. Memberships (users.manage; end-user token required → 403 for service clients)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 5. No token → 401 problem details
GET {{api}}/api/v1/me
